[November 3, 2024]: Sprint 1 Standup 4

- What did the team work on since the last standup?
  Completed the backend login functionality, with testing to ensure correct authentication and error handling.
  Began work on the backend transaction feature, focusing on the API routes for creating and processing transactions, but without connecting it to the frontend yet.

- What does the team commit to next?
  Finalize the transaction API to handle deposits, withdrawals, and account transfers, ensuring accurate processing in the database.
  Continue testing and debugging the backend to ensure it meets the project’s initial requirements before any front-end integration begins.

- When does the team expect to be done?
  The team aims to complete the transaction feature and all related backend testing by the end of the sprint, keeping the backend ready for front-end integration in future sprints.

- Does the team have any blockers?
  No major blockers, though there’s discussion on handling potential transaction issues like insufficient funds.

